!! _POC-XRLDP XR02(XRd・脇の系統の P・BGP なし)。LDP は PoC の段で足す(XRd が MPLS を転送するかの確かめ)。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.1.2 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description to RT04
 ipv4 address 10.1.4.2 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[4] }}
 description to RT05
 ipv4 address 10.1.5.2 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
router isis SIDE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0002.0100.0000.1002.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[4] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
!
